032400           PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
032500     END-EVALUATE
032600     IF WS-ROW-FOUND
032700        PERFORM 2100-RECORD-REVIEW THRU 2100-RECORD-REVIEW-EXIT
032800     END-IF
032900     .
033000 2000-SCHEDULE-EXIT.
033100     EXIT.
